<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{course}}"><view class="eyebrow">技巧研习</view><view class="title">{{course.title}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{course.summary}}</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">推理规则</view><view class="rule">{{course.rule}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="help">前置知识：{{course.prerequisites}}</view><view class="help">候选数表示仍可能填写的数字；同一行、列或宫中的格子互相可见。</view></view><view wx:if="{{status==='passed'}}" class="notice success">✓ 本课已通过。你独立完成了两道不同练习。</view><view wx:if="{{status==='needs-independent'}}" class="notice">待独立验证：未看答案的题目已不足两道。可以继续练习，等待后续补充新题。</view><view class="section-title heading">从理解到独立完成</view><button wx:for="{{lessons}}" wx:key="id" class="card lesson row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openLesson"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.label}}</text></button><view class="help heading">独立通过两道不同题即完成课程。请求关键提示后，本题记为辅助练习；无需找全所有删数。</view></block></view>
